# Marksman indexes every .md under the workspace root (~/Vaults, found via .git)
# and reads .gitignore / .hgignore / .ignore for exclusions. .trash holds 63 of
# the vault's 112 notes -- Obsidian's deleted copies plus a whole
# review-20260906/wiki-before-rewrite/ snapshot -- so every [[wiki link]] with a
# trashed namesake resolved to 2-3 candidates and came back as
# "Ambiguous link to document". .trash is tracked in git on purpose, so the
# exclusion goes here instead of .gitignore.
#
# ripgrep and fd honour this file too, which also keeps telescope out of .trash.
.trash/

# Agent scratch dirs: real notes never link into them, they only add noise to
# completion and workspace symbols.
.team/
.claudian/
